LTX 2.5 22B Distilled — Hybrid W4A8 / INT8 ConvRot for ComfyUI

This distribution contains modified model files derived from LTX 2.5 by
Lightricks Ltd. The official BF16 transformer and text encoder were quantized
in October 2026 by Agustín Meriles (ameriles). The files are not official
Lightricks releases, and no endorsement by Lightricks is implied.

Original sources:
https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-2.5

Quantization source and reproducibility materials:
https://github.com/ameriles/comfy-quant-bench

